;SUBROUTINE TO SEE IF A JOB HAS PRIVILEGE:
;CALL:	MOVE T1,BIT TO BE TESTED IN PRIVILEGE WORD
;	MOVE J,JOB NUMBER
;	PUSHJ P,PRVBIT
