;	PJRST PRVJ		;NO. CHECK FOR JACCT OR FSFPNN


;SUBROUTINE TO TEST FOR [1,2] OR JACCT -
;PRIVILEGES NEEDED IF A SETUUO FRO A SYSTEM-PARAMETER IS DONE
;RETURNS CPOPJ IF HAVE PRIVS, CPOPJ1 IF DONT
;RESPECTS T2


