␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	SUBTTL	SAVGET -- COMMON CODE

;ROUTINE TO SETUP ACS, RESET IO, AND SETUP LOWER CORE LOCATIONS
;FOR SAVE AND GET(SGALEN SET TO IOWD OR PP IF DTA OR DSK)
;SGADMP SET TO IOWD FOR THIS SIZE CORE
;CALL:	JSP T2,SG1
